(7470763, 1186016, 98339, '<td valign="top">For me this is a bit to "cooked"...and lacks clarity/sharpness.  I focus first on the bikes then the sighn therefore IMO your bikes should be razor sharp and clear.  But I think that you focused on the front/signage of the building.  Had your f-stop been higher you could have had it all...wink.</td>', 'For me this is a bit to "cooked"...and lacks clarity/sharpness.  I focus first on the bikes then the sighn therefore IMO your bikes should be razor sharp and clear.  But I think that you focused on the front/signage of the building.  Had your f-stop been higher you could have had it all...wink.', '2016-09-01 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470764, 1186571, 98339, '<td valign="top">For me this lacks clarity/sharpness, colors are flat.  Your f-stop is to low, focus is in the foreground not the buildings requiring a higher f-stop...</td>', 'For me this lacks clarity/sharpness, colors are flat.  Your f-stop is to low, focus is in the foreground not the buildings requiring a higher f-stop...', '2016-09-01 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470765, 1186422, 98339, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the processing here...it is a bit to "cooked" for me.  You have haloing around the goal stand and your colors are off a bit...dull/flat yet the grass is bright???</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the processing here...it is a bit to "cooked" for me.  You have haloing around the goal stand and your colors are off a bit...dull/flat yet the grass is bright???', '2016-09-01 11:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470766, 1186601, 98339, '<td valign="top">For me this lacks clarity/sharpness.  A High Pass filter would go a long ways on this...</td>', 'For me this lacks clarity/sharpness.  A High Pass filter would go a long ways on this...', '2016-09-01 11:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470767, 1186171, 98339, '<td valign="top">yes, this is urban but it lacks a focal point...something to draw me in.  And it''s a bit soft in the focus...you need a higher f-stop if you want to have everything in true sharp focus<br/> <br/>No offence intended</td>', 'yes, this is urban but it lacks a focal point...something to draw me in.  And it''s a bit soft in the focus...you need a higher f-stop if you want to have everything in true sharp focus No offence intended', '2016-09-01 11:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470768, 1186594, 98339, '<td valign="top">Usually I like dark toned photos, but this is lacking detail in the shadows.  It goes to the point of flat/dull.  Your main subject in this (the building)....doesn''t say "urban" to me.  Your buildings in the background are very secondary IMO.  That''s where your "urban" is...</td>', 'Usually I like dark toned photos, but this is lacking detail in the shadows.  It goes to the point of flat/dull.  Your main subject in this (the building)....doesn''t say "urban" to me.  Your buildings in the background are very secondary IMO.  That''s where your "urban" is...', '2016-09-01 11:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470769, 1186504, 98339, '<td valign="top">Typically I love deep, rich, dark tones....but in this I only see dark, shadows with loss of detail...</td>', 'Typically I love deep, rich, dark tones....but in this I only see dark, shadows with loss of detail...', '2016-09-01 11:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470770, 1186004, 98339, '<td valign="top">Not what I consider "urban".  Maybe that''s what your seeing beyond the curtain, but it''s not what I the viewer is seeing...</td>', 'Not what I consider "urban".  Maybe that''s what your seeing beyond the curtain, but it''s not what I the viewer is seeing...', '2016-09-01 11:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470771, 1186598, 98339, '<td valign="top">To much ground/trees that hide your subject...I take it you were driving?</td>', 'To much ground/trees that hide your subject...I take it you were driving?', '2016-09-01 11:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470772, 1186507, 98339, '<td valign="top">You probably were hand holding in this.  It''s very soft in focus/sharpness and your horizon is very tilted.</td>', 'You probably were hand holding in this.  It''s very soft in focus/sharpness and your horizon is very tilted.', '2016-09-01 11:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7470777, 1186538, 98339, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time equating this with "urban"...I guess it works, you got an extra point from me for interest/color.  You need to remember this for another appropriate challenge...</td>', 'I''m having a hard time equating this with "urban"...I guess it works, you got an extra point from me for interest/color.  You need to remember this for another appropriate challenge...', '2016-09-01 11:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
