(7470784, 1186168, 98339, '<td valign="top">Different I''ll give you that.  I want more buildings vs ally.  And your building is lacking in total clarity/sharpness.</td>', 'Different I''ll give you that.  I want more buildings vs ally.  And your building is lacking in total clarity/sharpness.', '2016-09-01 11:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
