(7472340, 1186262, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> The blur doesn''t work for me. They payoff of the building a third of the way up the image, isn''t strong enough. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You''re right, it probably would have looked better without the blur, or with a less invasive one; I shot this while playing with Tilt and Shift and had very little time before I had to rush home, I should have shut the aperture a bit, reducing the blur.<br/> <br/>Thanks for leaving your feedback!</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: The blur doesn''t work for me. They payoff of the building a third of the way up the image, isn''t strong enough.   You''re right, it probably would have looked better without the blur, or with a less invasive one; I shot this while playing with Tilt and Shift and had very little time before I had to rush home, I should have shut the aperture a bit, reducing the blur. Thanks for leaving your feedback!', '2016-09-05 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
